  "articleBody": "A whole-house renovation is easiest to control when design, structural needs, permits, materials, and construction are planned as one coordinated scope. Before hiring, define how you want the home to function, request a written proposal that separates allowances from fixed costs, and confirm who handles drawings, permit applications, inspections, and final corrections.",
